{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>לבבכם וסרתם ועבדתם אלהים אחרים והשתחויתם להם</b>. Seven times in the Masorah; corresponding to them: פתחי לי אחותי רעיתי יונתי תמתי שראשי — seven yods in the Masorah. To teach: whoever acknowledges idolatry is as one who denies the Ten Commandments, which were given on the fortieth day. And likewise seven times, for seven blemishes are written of idolatry: פה להם ולא ידברו etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:23.508490627Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}